# WRF v4.7.1, github.com/wrf-model/WRF tag v4.7.1 (commit f52c197ed39d12e087d02c50f412d90d418f6186). sha256 of each
# file as fetched from raw.githubusercontent.com/wrf-model/WRF/v4.7.1/<path>. build.sh compiles the two routines it
# cuts from dyn_em/module_initialize_real.F (rebalance, lines 4982-5266) and dyn_em/nest_init_utils.F
# (blend_terrain, lines 712-785), and share/module_model_constants.F whole. The other files are pinned because the
# port cites them line by line: main/ndown_em.F (the order: interpolate, vertical_interp, blend once, rebalance every
# frame), share/interp_fcn.F (interp_mask_field), share/module_soil_pre.F (adjust_soil_temp_new) and
# Registry/Registry.EM_COMMON (blend_width default 5; the auxinput2 fields ndown reads from the fine grid's file).
